# 2. PRODUCT IDENTITY

PRODUCT NAME: OppSift

PRODUCT CATEGORY: Global Opportunity Intelligence Platform.

PRODUCT POSITIONING:

OppSift helps businesses, organisations, consultants and professionals discover relevant opportunities, understand their requirements, evaluate eligibility and manage their opportunity pipeline.

Opportunity categories include:

- Government tenders.
- Public procurement.
- Contracts.
- Requests for Proposals (RFPs).
- Grants.
- Funding programmes.
- Commercial opportunities.
- Other supported opportunity categories.

CORE PRODUCT VALUE:

Discover the right opportunity. Understand it. Know what to do next.

OppSift is not simply a directory of tenders.

It is an intelligence platform that brings opportunity discovery, analysis, eligibility understanding, matching, monitoring and opportunity management together.

The product is global-first.

Do not design it as a Kenya-only or Africa-only platform.

Countries, currencies, languages, dates, time zones and organisations must be treated as international product requirements.

Do not claim complete global coverage. Display only countries and sources that the actual platform supports.

